  "summary": "作者用王董事长命例区分决策者与执行者：开创冲劲有余但谨慎不足，须好行运支持；受雇执行可能表现更佳，不能与董事长决策风险等同。其离开家族企业创业遭不利限运与角色相应，武破巳命虽强仍无成就，结论限于此命例及职业条件。",
  "summary_en": "Chairman Wang’s case contrasts entrepreneurial decision-making with employed execution. The author describes strong initiative but insufficient caution, requiring favorable timing for independent business. An employee carrying out policy might perform well without bearing the same strategic risk. Wang left an established family appliance business around forty but encountered unfavorable cycles and a role matching the adverse side of his configuration. Strong Wu Qu and Po Jun in the Life Palace at Si did not ensure success. These claims remain case- and occupation-dependent.",
